From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BCR Maintainers <bcr-maintainers@bazel.build>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Forward SYSTEMROOT for Windows compiler discovery

Bazel 9 enables strict repository environments in BCR presubmit jobs. Forward
SYSTEMROOT so the resource compiler can be discovered on Windows.

diff --git a/rc/cc.bazelrc b/rc/cc.bazelrc
index a48de41..23057dc 100644
--- a/rc/cc.bazelrc
+++ b/rc/cc.bazelrc
@@ -2,3 +2,6 @@

 # Ensure that C/C++ toolchain resolution is hermetic
 common --repo_env=BAZEL_DO_NOT_DETECT_CPP_TOOLCHAIN=1
+
+# Preserve Windows toolchain discovery with strict repository environments.
+common:windows --repo_env=SYSTEMROOT
--
2.47.0
